  "word_count": 114,
  "text_content": "Femi loves to play football. On most afternoons, he plays with his friends after school. One day, his new ball flew over the wall. Femi looked everywhere, but he could not find it. He looked in the long grass. He looked by the gate. Nothing was there. He felt sad and sat down by the road. Then Bisi came and told him not to cry. Bisi had a long stick with a hook on the end. Together they looked over the wall. The ball was stuck in a big tree. Bisi reached up and pulled it down with the stick. Femi jumped for joy and hugged his friend. Now Femi keeps his ball safe.",
